# Product context

Multi-college SaaS. Every college-scoped row has `tenant_id`. Students see a job only after TPO approval.

- Auth now is email and password. SSO is later.
- No in-app chat, SMS, or WhatsApp. Email only.
- No built-in aptitude or coding tests.
- Schema changes go through Knex migrations only. No ORM.
- Feature flags `ai`, `analytics`, `extra_seats`, `branding` stay enabled and free until billing is turned on. Do not charge.

```text
BAD: student query without tenant_id
GOOD: where({ tenant_id: req.tenantId, id })
```
